 
NFR01 
Accessibility [CANDIDATE] - The UI will use industry standard WCAG 2.1 accessibility standards. 
relevance - Accessibility is important so all students with different needs can use the system

NFR02
Performance [CANDIDATE] - under the colleges normal daily use, the loadtime shall be less then 2 seconds 
relevance - slow loading times can discourage a student from booking an appoitnment they need.

NFR04
Reliability/Availibility [CANDIDATE] - System maintenance should only be scheduled outside of academic hours e.g. 00:00 - 05:00
relevance - Students and staff need access to the system during academic hours

NFR05
Usability [CANDIDATE] - A first time student should be able to locate the service they are looking for and complete a booking within 3 minutes.
relevance - students are currently not availing of college supports, if the system is complicated, it may disuade them from making a booking.
